<title>AUSTRIA: Kuwait expects six month OPEC rollover today.</title>
<headline>Kuwait expects six month OPEC rollover today.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwaiti oil minister Isa al-Mazeedi said he expected a six month OPEC output rollover from today's meeting.</p>
<p>Asked when leaving his hotel for the meeting whether he expected OPEC to agree to a six month rollover he said &quot;Yes we are.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;Everybody is talking about a rollover, should there be a rollover it is fair to expect it to go for six months,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
